Fauna Garden
============

Fauna Garden is a port of Animal Crops (Minecraft 1.18.2, Forge) by KnightMiner to
Minecraft 1.21.1 (Forge, then NeoForge).
The code and assets have been modified (renamed, ported to the 1.21.1 APIs).
